OL,3,AHawaii's iconic 550-year-old HEMlei Sea
OL,4,AArch collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FHawaii's famous HEMlei Sea Arch, a
OL,7,F90-foot-tall (27.4m) lava rock
OL,8,Fstructure that formed about 550 years
OL,9,Fago, has collapsed into the Pacific
OL,10,FOcean.
OL,12,FThe collapse's exact time is not known.
OL,13,FThe arch was still projecting into the
OL,14,Fwater from the coast of Volcanoes
OL,15,FNational Park on 23 September, but was
OL,16,Fgone by 27 September, the National Park
OL,17,FService (NPS) said.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
