OL,3,AHawaii's iconic 550-year-old HEMlei Sea
OL,4,AArch collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The coastline flanking the sea arch
OL,7,Fhas shown signs of instability for
OL,8,Fyears," NPS, which warned in 2021 that
OL,9,Fthe arch would eventually crumble, said
OL,10,Fin a statement.
OL,12,FLocated at the end of Chain of Craters
OL,13,FRoad on the island of Hawaii, also
OL,14,Fcalled "the big island", the formation
OL,15,Fwas a popular - and heavily
OL,16,Fphotographed - tourist destination.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
